   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85258-43B.recto.1_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0045_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/><supplied resp="#DW">bhṭybʾl</supplied> Y PWN dsṭkr[ṭ' dʾl]yk
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> ẔNH BYRḤ hwrdṭ Y (ŠNṬ)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/><supplied resp="#DW">$$-IIII-IIII</supplied> ʾMṬ L PWN dsṭkrṭ'
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>Y wndʾṭbwlcm(ṭ)rʾp̄ʾṭ' YḤWWN(ṭ)
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>Ḥ(WH)m ʾwcyṭ' (W) wndʾṭ' lwd
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>LWTḤ L G-$$ K-#III-(IIII) Y b(w)n'
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>L kwlʾck ʿL lsykʾn YḤBWN(ṭ')
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>ck' kwlṭwy ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0045_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/><supplied resp="#DW">Baxtiyār</supplied> ī pad dastgir[d dār]īg
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> ēn māh Hordad ī sāl
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/><supplied resp="#DW">48</supplied> ka man pad dastgird
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ī Windādburzmihr-ābād būd
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>hēm uzīd (ud) windād rōy
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>abāg man g(rīw) 40 k(abīz) 8 ī bun
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>man kulāčag ō rahīgān dād
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>čak Kurdōy āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0045_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/><supplied resp="#DW">Baxtiyār</supplied>, the manager of the estate,
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/>, this month Hordad of the year
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>(48) when I was on the Estate
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>of Windādburzmihr-ābād
               <lb n="5-6" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-6"/>went out and acquired, with my assistance, 40 grīw 8 kabīz of copper of the bun.
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>I gave a small bun (of copper) to the boys.
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>Kurdōy sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>